            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "We have designed an approach to assessing the temporal behaviour and global spatial distribution of ET over the past 27 years. It integrates point-wise ET measurements at the FLUXNET observing sites with geospatial information from satellite remote sensing and surface meteorological data in a machine-learning algorithm (the model tree ensemble or MTE; ref 4).",
