            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "Our global land-ET estimate, derived from FLUXNET, remote sensing and meteorological observations, suggests that the rate of land ET increased from the early 1980s to the late 1990s with a linear trend of 7.1 \u00b1 1 mm per year per decade for 1982\u20131997 (P<0.01 according to the Mann-Kendall test).",
